# BuildKit reads this file for hosted/Dockerfile (the build context is mcp/, so a plain
# .dockerignore would have to live there and would also apply to unrelated builds).
# Only what the build stage copies is sent: manifests, ts/, hosted/ sources.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!hosted/.env.example
js
mcpb
plugin
test
scripts
DESIGN.md
README.md
server.json
*.mcpb
hosted/test
hosted/plugin
hosted/listing
hosted/deploy
hosted/.scratch
